{"version": 2, "width": 105, "height": 38, "timestamp": 1794917034, "title": "Raft Month 2 Demo: Network Partition, CheckQuorum Step-Down & Majority Failover", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "powershell"}}
[0.3, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m=========================================================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.4, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m            RAFT DISTRIBUTED CONSENSUS ENGINE \u2014 MONTH 2 MILESTONE DEMONSTRATION                          \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.5, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[37m       Deterministic Simulation: Pre-Vote, Leader Stickiness, CheckQuorum & Fault Invariants             \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m=========================================================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.8, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b6 Step 1: Initializing 5-Node Cluster under Deterministic Simulation (Seed 202)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.9, "o", "\u001b[2m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.0, "o", "[\u001b[32mINIT\u001b[0m] Cluster size N=5 (Quorum = 3). Safe defaults: PreVote=ON, Stickiness=ON, CheckQuorum=ON.\r\n"]
[1.2, "o", "[\u001b[36mSIM\u001b[0m] Stepping FakeClock and SimNetwork. Election timers running...\r\n"]
[1.5, "o", "[\u001b[33mPREVOTE\u001b[0m] Node 5 election timer expired -> Transitions to PreCandidate (Term 0, Speculative 1).\r\n"]
[1.7, "o", "[\u001b[33mPREVOTE\u001b[0m] Node 5 receives speculative pre-votes from Node 1, 2, 4 -> Achieved quorum (4/5)!\r\n"]
[1.9, "o", "[\u001b[35mELECTION\u001b[0m] Node 5 increments term to 1, votes for self, broadcasts RequestVote RPCs.\r\n"]
[2.2, "o", "[\u001b[32mELECTED\u001b[0m] \u001b[1m\u001b[32mNode 5 achieved majority votes (4/5) and transitioned to LEADER for Term 1!\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.4, "o", "[\u001b[36mHEARTBEAT\u001b[0m] Leader Node 5 dispatches heartbeats every 20ms. Followers reset election timers.\r\n\r\n"]
[2.7, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b6 Step 2: Injecting Asymmetric Network Partition (Minority vs Majority)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.8, "o", "\u001b[2m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.0, "o", "[\u001b[31mFAULT\u001b[0m] \u001b[1m\u001b[31mPartitioning cluster into:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.2, "o", "       \u2022 Minority partition: {Node 1, Node 5 (old leader)} (2 nodes < quorum)\r\n"]
[3.4, "o", "       \u2022 Majority partition: {Node 2, Node 3, Node 4}               (3 nodes >= quorum)\r\n"]
[3.7, "o", "[\u001b[31mISOLATION\u001b[0m] Leader Node 5 heartbeats fail to reach majority partition {2, 3, 4}.\r\n\r\n"]
[4.0, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b6 Step 3: Majority Partition Re-Election under Pre-Vote (\u00a79.6)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.1, "o", "\u001b[2m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.3, "o", "[\u001b[33mTIMEOUT\u001b[0m] In majority partition, Node 3 election timer expires...\r\n"]
[4.5, "o", "[\u001b[33mPREVOTE\u001b[0m] Node 3 gathers majority pre-votes from Node 2 and Node 4 (3/5 quorum granted).\r\n"]
[4.8, "o", "[\u001b[35mELECTION\u001b[0m] Node 3 advances to Candidate for Term 2, broadcasts real votes.\r\n"]
[5.1, "o", "[\u001b[32mRE-ELECTION\u001b[0m] \u001b[1m\u001b[32mNode 3 elected as NEW LEADER for Term 2 in majority partition!\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.3, "o", "[\u001b[36mAUTHORITY\u001b[0m] Node 3 begins sending heartbeats for Term 2 to {Node 2, Node 4}.\r\n\r\n"]
[5.6, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b6 Step 4: CheckQuorum (\u00a76.2) Automatic Minority Step-Down\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.7, "o", "\u001b[2m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.9, "o", "[\u001b[31mCHECK_QUORUM\u001b[0m] Leader Node 5 check-quorum lease timer expires (contact with only 1/5 nodes within timeout).\r\n"]
[6.2, "o", "[\u001b[31mSTEP_DOWN\u001b[0m] \u001b[1m\u001b[31mNode 5 voluntarily steps down to Follower: reason = quorum_loss (\u00a76.2).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.4, "o", "[\u001b[32mSAFETY\u001b[0m] Stale leader in minority stepped down WITHOUT needing to see a higher term.\r\n\r\n"]
[6.7, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b6 Step 5: Partition Healing & Cluster Stabilization\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.8, "o", "\u001b[2m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.0, "o", "[\u001b[32mHEAL\u001b[0m] SimNetwork partition healed. Bidirectional connectivity restored across all 5 nodes.\r\n"]
[7.3, "o", "[\u001b[36mDISCOVERY\u001b[0m] Node 1 and Node 5 receive Term 2 heartbeats from Node 3.\r\n"]
[7.5, "o", "[\u001b[36mSTEP_DOWN\u001b[0m] Node 1 and Node 5 update term to 2, acknowledge Node 3 as the single cluster leader.\r\n"]
[7.8, "o", "[\u001b[32mSTABILITY\u001b[0m] Verified 20 consecutive clock ticks: cluster stable on Node 3 (Term 2) with 0 deadlocks.\r\n\r\n"]
[8.0, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m=========================================================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.1, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m                                     PER-NODE METRICS SUMMARY                                            \u001b[0m\r\n"]
